Oakle is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Nintendo,
Game Freak or The Pokemon Company. Pokemon and Pokemon character names are trademarks of their owners.

This repository contains NO game data: no ROM, no sprites, no music. The game is built locally from the public
pret/pokeyellow disassembly (fetched at build time by rom/build.sh, pinned to one commit) plus the patch in
rom/patches/. The favicon, the social
card and the small team pictures are generated or downloaded at build time and are not committed (the pictures come
from the Yellow sprites in github.com/PokeAPI/sprites).

Whoever deploys Oakle serves the ROM they built to their visitors, from their own domain. That is the deployer's
responsibility, and a rights holder may ask for it to be taken down. Never commit a ROM, sprites, music or generated
images to this repository (scripts/prepublish-check.sh enforces this).

